{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15522","headline":"自平阳馆赴郡 · 畅当","name":"自平阳馆赴郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨兴平阳馆，见月沈江水。\n溶溶山雾披，肃肃沙鹭起。\n奉恩谬符竹，伏轼省顽鄙。\n何当施教化，愧迎小郡史。\n寥落火耕俗，征途青冥里。\n德绥及吾民，不德将鹿矣。\n擒奸非性能，多愍会衰齿。\n恭承共理诏，恒惧坠诸地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}